cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "RehabImmersive-Kinematic-Analysis: a browser-based kinematic analysis tool for upper-limb rehabilitation in immersive virtual reality"
abstract: "Software ecosystem for upper-limb neurorehabilitation combining virtual reality serious games for Meta Quest with a privacy-preserving, browser-based tool for post hoc kinematic analysis. The tool computes clinical metrics (range of motion, movement smoothness and path efficiency) from head and hand motion logs, without external motion-capture infrastructure."
